<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109427" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπότροπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποτρέπομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turning back, returning,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπότροπον ἐκ πολέμοιο ἵξεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.501
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἵκετο δῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					20.332
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἵξομαι αὖτις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.367
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἔθ᾽ ὑπότροποι αὖθις ἔσεσθε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ap.</u>
					476
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. οἴκαδ᾽ ἱκέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					21.211
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>rallying</i> from the effect of a blow, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				25.263
			</span></i>.</div>
